        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana PRHHL/PRHHDL, Highgate Handleset for Double Doors</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Highgate Handleset is packaged as a complete set for a pair of Double Doors including one side with a <b>Single Cylinder Function</b> and the other <b>Dummy Function</b>. For the single cylinder, a thumb piece operates the latch and a key operates the deadbolt from the exterior; and the lever operates the latch and a thumbturn operates the deadbolt from the interior. The Dummy Function does not function--neither locking nor latching. The Highgate Double Door Handleset with Dummy is designed to fit doors 1-3/8 inches through 2 inches thick with backsets of either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. Choose from satin nickel, polished chrome, polished brass, or oil rubbed bronze finishes for this modern handleset.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching <a href=\"/products/modern-livingston-lever-with-square-rose-deltana-zlls\"><b>Livingston Lever</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Highgate Double Door Entrance Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>ANSI grade 2 security.</li>\r\n<li>Schlage C keyway compatible.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Highgate Double Door Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Deadbolt Length: 3-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt Width: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Top Mount Length: 3-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Top Mount Width: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Bottom Mount Length: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Bottom Mount Width: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Handleset Projection: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 11-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Length c.c.: 8-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Rose Length: 2-5/8\" square</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Inside Deadbolt Length: 2-5/8\" square</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" up to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: adjustable for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-PRHHL-specifications.pdf?v=1704262316\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana PRHHL/PRHHDL Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Comes packaged with everything you need for a set of double doors including 1 single cylinder handle, 1 dummy handle, and 2 matching levers.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Highgate Double Door Handleset with Dummy",
                "description": "This Highgate Handleset is packaged as a complete set for a pair of Double Doors including one side with a Single Cylinder Function and the other Dummy Function. For the single cylinder, a thumb piece operates the latch and a key operates the deadbolt from the exterior; and the lever operates the latch and a thumbturn operates the deadbolt from the interior. The Dummy Function does not function--neither locking nor latching. The Highgate Double Door Handleset with Dummy is designed to fit doors 1-3/8 inches through 2 inches thick with backsets of either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. Choose from satin nickel, polished chrome, polished brass, or oil rubbed bronze finishes for this modern handleset.",
